@GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010

GET {{GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress}}/api/plants/categories
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress}}/api/plants/category/vegetables
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress}}/api/address/search?query=New+York
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress}}/api/garden/design
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-1",
  "address": {
    "displayName": "New York, NY",
    "latitude": 40.7128,
    "longitude": -74.0060
  },
  "gardenArea": {
    "polygon": [
      { "lat": 40.7128, "lng": -74.0060 },
      { "lat": 40.7138, "lng": -74.0060 },
      { "lat": 40.7138, "lng": -74.0050 },
      { "lat": 40.7128, "lng": -74.0050 }
    ],
    "areaSquareMeters": 100
  },
  "selectedPlantIds": ["tomato", "carrot", "basil"]
}

###

POST {{GardenAdvisor.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gardener@example.com",
  "name": "Garden Enthusiast"
}

###
